# Autocomplete

Get search suggestions through the current transport.

```svelte
<script>
  import Chemical from "chemicaljs/Chemical";

  let chemical = $state();

  async function getSuggestions() {
    await chemical.autocomplete("math"))
  }
</script>

<Chemical
  bind:this={chemical}
/>
```

## Parsing Data

Results are return in json format with `plain` and `rich` results from Google

```js
[
    {
        "type": "plain",
        "data": [
            {
                "text": "g",
                "highlight": false
            },
            {
                "text": "mail",
                "highlight": true
            }
        ],
        "fullURL": "gmail"
    },
    {
        "type": "rich",
        "data": {
            "title": "Google",
            "image": "data:image/png;base64"
        }
    },
]
```